Subject: [PATCH 19/22] POC-11c: overworld self-tests (scripted keys in a real
 map, frame dumps)

PKBN_OWTEST starts a new game in a chosen map with a party and plays a key
script (waits, presses, holds, A-mash, frame dumps, scripted additem, wild
battle start; battles can use the self-test autopilot). Verified: START ->
FOLDER, party menu -> NAVICUST, Mart -> CHIPS, field wild battle round trip,
TM from a script, Move Relearner chip. Grants now log a line.

